      "literalGroups": [
        {
          "group": "prompt_ordered_answers_key",
          "literal": {
            "prompt": "Кто был выбран военачальником Второго народного ополчения в 1612 году?",
            "answers": [
              "Кузьма Минин",
              "Дмитрий Пожарский",
              "Василий Шуйский",
              "Михаил Кутузов"
            ],
            "correctIndex": 1
          },
          "literalSHA256": "1d6ceaed9c364e140390c617543406712ae5465e998b1c6327139683f5ff118f",
          "primaryGround": "L79-L82 state the Second militia in 1612 and distinguish its organizer Minin from commander Pozharsky; L80 explicitly says Pozharsky was chosen commander. The options are all historical people: Minin, Pozharsky, Shuisky, Kutuzov. Kutuzov’s separate 1812 command is grounded at L71-L77 of the retained Kutuzov source.",
          "locator": "L79-L82; Kutuzov L71-L77",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a15e25/source-history-russia25/raw/prlib-minin-pozharsky.json",
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a15db1/source-history-russia17/raw/prlib-kutuzov-1812.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "explanation",
          "literal": "Князь Дмитрий Пожарский был выбран военачальником Второго народного ополчения. Кузьма Минин организовал движение и сбор средств, а Пожарский руководил войском.",
          "literalSHA256": "3547481835e19bab9d0ff42098c6d4e7d30f1d1010097ff33005d550206f16e8",
          "primaryGround": "L79 says Minin organized the movement and funds; L80 explicitly names Pozharsky as the chosen commander; L81-L82 describe the march and liberation of Moscow.",
          "locator": "L79-L82",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a15e25/source-history-russia25/raw/prlib-minin-pozharsky.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note0",
          "literal": "Минин, нижегородский земский староста, организовал сбор средств и созыв ополчения.",
          "literalSHA256": "5edb6028f2e412204ca4ae3b25481773acdd5aef7a8dea7c6b28f4b535b2bdd6",
          "primaryGround": "L79 identifies Minin as the Nizhny Novgorod zemstvo elder and says he persuaded the assembly to form the militia and collect funds.",
          "locator": "L79",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a15e25/source-history-russia25/raw/prlib-minin-pozharsky.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note1",
          "literal": "Пожарский был ранен в боях в составе Первого ополчения, которое не смогло освободить Москву.",
          "literalSHA256": "49c694130b6fffa6c36393823148bf068b7dca4893586f0ef032dc7045a02313",
          "primaryGround": "L80 says Pozharsky was wounded fighting Poles with the First People’s Militia and that this first militia failed to liberate Moscow. This adds a distinct fact about this answer.",
          "locator": "L80",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a15e25/source-history-russia25/raw/prlib-minin-pozharsky.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note2",
          "literal": "Василий Шуйский был царём; Пожарский состоял у него на службе.",
          "literalSHA256": "2e50680fac74b9a24dac8216feaee80bf2a5145eca9314f12c7a26b8cd2d6ad6",
          "primaryGround": "L80 identifies Vasily Shuisky as tsar and says Pozharsky served him.",
          "locator": "L80",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a15e25/source-history-russia25/raw/prlib-minin-pozharsky.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note3",
          "literal": "Кутузов командовал русскими армиями в Отечественную войну 1812 года.",
          "literalSHA256": "ec7a90343da282cb538fef5fa235aa45da29891f865b906809424bff610a3970",
          "primaryGround": "The retained official biography says Kutuzov was commander-in-chief of Russian armies in 1812 and describes his campaign against Napoleon.",
          "locator": "L71-L77",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a15db1/source-history-russia17/raw/prlib-kutuzov-1812.json"
          ]
        }
      ],
